aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuY29ycmVpb2JyYXppbGllbnNlLmNvbS5ici9jaWRhZGVzLWRmLzIwMjYvMTEvNzUzMjkwNy1kZi1zb21hLTQyNS1jYXNvcy1kZS1tcG94LWRlc2RlLTIwMjItb2l0by1mb3JhbS1jb25maXJtYWRvcy1lbS1vdXR1YnJvLWRlc3RlLWFuby5odG1s,WATCH,ブラジル連邦直轄区で継続的にmpox症例が報告されているが、重症度や急増の兆候は示されておらず、既知の流行パターンの延長と見られるため経過観察とする。,Mpox,,The Federal District has reached 425 mpox cases since 2022; eight were confirmed in October this year.,DF soma 425 casos de mpox desde 2022; oito foram confirmados em outubro deste ano,2026-11-04T11:23:48+00:00,https://www.correiobraziliense.com.br/cidades-df/2026/11/7532907-df-soma-425-casos-de-mpox-desde-2022-oito-foram-confirmados-em-outubro-deste-ano.html,PORTUGUESE,humans,"Mpox in Brazil’s Federal District (Distrito Federal, DF) reached 425 confirmed cases since 2022, with 402 cases reported 2022–2025 and 23 in 2026; eight cases were diagnosed in October 2026, according to the DF Health Secretariat (SES-DF). The central public health laboratory Lacen-DF is conducting additional analyses to identify the circulating viral strain; a predominant strain has not yet been conclusively determined. From 2022–2025, the vast majority of cases were male (96%), with a median age of 33 years; the 30–39-year age group accounted for 45.8%, and 20–29 years for 29.4%. Alerts emphasize rapid appearance of mucosal lesions or acute skin eruptions anywhere on the body. Preventive measures include avoiding close contact with individuals with suspicious skin lesions, frequent hand hygiene, and not sharing personal items. If mpox is suspected or confirmed, isolate as advised by health professionals.",No,No,不明,No,0,No,不明,Yes,Yes,不明,2,不明,Yes,No,ブラジルは対象国リストに含まれないため verified_locations は空配列。地域保健当局による継続的なサーベイランス報告であり、新興の異常事態を示す情報はない。,
