,Yes,発生地域にはフランス・ケニア・ウガンダ・ナイジェリアも含まれるが、これらは対象国リストに含まれないため除外。主要発生国であるDRCのみをverified_locationsに記載。ワクチンの有効性不明、医療従事者への感染（301人中48人死亡）、武力紛争による対応困難など、国際支援の必要性が高い。,
aHR0cHM6Ly9pbmZvcm1hdGlvbi50djVtb25kZS5jb20vaW50ZXJuYXRpb25hbC9yZC1jb25nby1hcHJlcy1kZXMtZGVjZXMtZGhpcHBvcG90YW1lcy1kZS1sYW50aHJheC1sZXMtYXV0b3JpdGVzLWFsZXJ0ZW50LXN1ci11bmUtcG9zc2libGUtdHJhbnNtaXNzaW9uLWxob21tZS0yODQ0NDIy,PICKUP,DRCヴィルンガ国立公園で炭疽による野生動物（カバ）大量死が再発し、当局がヒトへの感染リスクを警告・啓発活動を開始しているため、WPRO基準（異常性・重症度・曝露継続・対応能力）に複数該当し社会的関心も高い。,Anthrax,Province du Nord-Kivu; State of South Australia; Binza; Butembo; Lubero; Democratic Republic of the Congo; Commonwealth of Australia,"DR Congo: after hippopotamuses died of anthrax, authorities warn of possible transmission to humans.","RD Congo: après des décès d'hippopotames de l'anthrax, les autorités alertent sur une possible transmission à l'homme",2026-11-04T16:12:33+00:00,https://information.tv5monde.com/international/rd-congo-apres-des-deces-dhippopotames-de-lanthrax-les-autorites-alertent-sur-une-possible-transmission-lhomme-2844422,FRENCH,environment; humans; animals,"Anthrax outbreak decimates wildlife in Democratic Republic of Congo's Virunga National Park, North Kivu, with about 30 hippos/we have wildlife deaths observed since September along the Semuliki River and Lake Edward. Laboratory analyses confirmed Bacillus anthracis as the cause; authorities warn of possible transmission to humans and have begun a community-awareness campaign. This marks the second such outbreak in DRC since last year, which killed around 65 hippos in Virunga and affected residents in Lubero, Butembo and Binza. Transmission occurs via contact with infected carcasses, consumption of contaminated meat, or water near contaminated sites. Measures include avoiding carcass contact, not consuming tainted meat, boiling water, and keeping children and livestock away from the area. Clinical forms include cutaneous, gastrointestinal, and inhalational; inhalational is the most lethal, with mortality 80–100% without early treatment.",不明,Yes,No,不明,1,Yes,Yes,Yes,No,Yes,4,Yes,Yes,不明,発生地域にAustraliaが含まれているが、記事サマリーに言及なくBluedotの誤付与と判断し除外した。ヒトへの確定感染例は本記事では明示されていないため、公衆衛生への深刻な影響は『不明』とした。,
