aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZWZzeW4uZ3Iva29zbW9zLzE1MDMyMTEvZXBpZGltaWEtaG9sZXJhcy1zdG8tbGQta29uZ2tvLTEtODAwLW5la3JvaS1hcG8tdGluLWFyaGktdG95LWV0b3lzLXBhZ2tvc21pb3Mtb3JnYW5pc21vcy15Z2VpYXMv,PICKUP,"コレラ症例6万件超・死者1,800人に加え、同時進行するエボラ出血熱（死者5,300人超）という複合的な公衆衛生危機であり、IHR基準の複数（深刻性・異常性・国際拡大リスク）に該当するためフルリスク評価が必要。",Cholera; Ebola,South Kivu Province; Kinshasa City; Kinshasa; Democratic Republic of the Congo,"Cholera epidemic in DR Congo: 1,800 deaths since the start of the year (World Health Organization).",Επιδημία χολέρας στο ΛΔ Κονγκό: 1.800 νεκροί από την αρχή του έτους (Παγκόσμιος Οργανισμός Υγείας),2026-11-04T19:22:52+00:00,https://www.efsyn.gr/kosmos/1503211/epidimia-holeras-sto-ld-kongko-1-800-nekroi-apo-tin-arhi-toy-etoys-pagkosmios-organismos-ygeias/,GREEK,humans; environment,"Cholera outbreak in the Democratic Republic of Congo reaches over 60,000 cases and 1,800 deaths in 2026, while the country grapples with an Ebola epidemic that has caused more than 5,300 deaths among 10,400 cases in five months, per the World Health Organization. The majority of cholera deaths and infections remain in the eastern provinces of North Kivu and South Kivu, but cases are spreading along the Congo River basin, raising concerns about movement toward Kinshasa in the west. WHO Director-General Tedros Adhanom Ghebreyesus notes that 2025 recorded the highest cholera burden in 25 years and that 2026 may be worse. The report highlights entrenched transmission patterns and the potential for cross-regional spread, underscoring the urgent need for intensified public health measures amid concurrent outbreaks.",Yes,Yes,Yes,不明,3,Yes,Yes,Yes,Yes,Yes,5,Yes,Yes,Yes,コレラとエボラの同時流行というDRC国内の複合危機。WHO事務局長が2025年を過去25年で最悪のコレラ負担と指摘し、2026年はさらに悪化する可能性があるとしている。コンゴ川流域を通じた首都キンシャサへの拡大懸念も指摘されており、国際的な注視が必要。,
