aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuaXRhdGlhaWEuY29tLmJyL3NhdWRlL21wb3gtcmlvLWRlLWphbmVpcm8tcmVjZWJlLW1haXMtZGUtMi1taWwtZG9zZXMtZGUtdmFjaW5hLWFwb3MtcmVnaXN0cmFyLTI2OS1jYXNvcy1lbS0yMDI2Lw==,WATCH,ブラジル・リオデジャネイロ州でMpox症例が2025年比で増加しワクチン接種が強化されているが、重症例・死亡報告はなく国際的拡大の兆候も明記されていないため、経過観察が妥当。,Mpox; HIV,Rio de Janeiro; Rio de Janeiro; Federative Republic of Brazil,"Mpox: Rio de Janeiro receives more than 2,000 vaccine doses after recording 269 cases in 2026.",Mpox: Rio de Janeiro recebe mais de 2 mil doses de vacina após registrar 269 casos em 2026,2026-11-04T22:11:53+00:00,https://www.itatiaia.com.br/saude/mpox-rio-de-janeiro-recebe-mais-de-2-mil-doses-de-vacina-apos-registrar-269-casos-em-2026/,PORTUGUESE,humans,"Rio de Janeiro received more than 2,000 mpox vaccine doses on November 4, 2026, raising the state's 2026 total to 3,500 doses after 269 confirmed mpox cases (Jan 1–Nov 3). No mpox deaths reported in 2026 through early November; in the same period of 2025, 92 cases were recorded. The vaccination regimen remains two doses 28 days apart. Distribution to municipalities is coordinated by SES-RJ; immunizations are organized by municipal health secretariats. The national vaccination strategy prioritizes people living with HIV/AIDS with CD4 counts under 100 cells/mm³ due to higher risk of severe disease; eligible individuals must be registered at Centers of Reference for follow-up. Doses may be limited to remaining supply for HIV/AIDS with CD4 < 200, PrEP users, and laboratory personnel handling mpox samples.",No,No,不明,No,0,Yes,No,Yes,Yes,No,3,不明,Yes,No,症例数は前年同期比で増加（92→269）しているが死亡例なし。HIV陽性者など免疫不全者を優先したワクチン接種戦略が実施されており、州レベルでの対応として管理されている模様。,
